# GraphKpi

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphKpi } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphKpi
  title="example"
  value="example"
  label="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `value` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `label` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `hint?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `data` | `number[]` | `—` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphKpiProps`
